silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_08_sections_01_concrete_anchor_1#inconsistencystatebot silm:hasLongDescription "The InconsistencyStateBot is the absorbing-zero state at the cat-level olog category. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'bot_Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
